    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construction simulator where one of the players plays the role of a foreman who has to catch drunk players. And the rest of the drunk players have to run, hide and look for alcohol on the construction site to survive.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chief wins when all the players become sober</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The rest of the players wins when they complete the construction tasks</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with you friends or random people 1vs2, 1vs3 or 1vs4</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 Game Modes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Base game mode with foreman where players sober up and need to be resuced by teammates</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Base with forman where players when get sobbered spawn after some amount of time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destruction mode where the winner is who destroy more objects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <strong>The game is meant to be played for 2-5 people for the optimal experience</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construction simulator where one of the players plays the role of a foreman who has to catch drunk players. And the rest of the drunk players have to run, hide and look for alcohol on the construction site to survive.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chief wins when all the players become sober</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The rest of the players wins when they complete the construction tasks</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with you friends or random people 1vs2, 1vs3 or 1vs4</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 Game Modes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Base game mode with foreman where players sober up and need to be resuced by teammates</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Base with forman where players when get sobbered spawn after some amount of time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destruction mode where the winner is who destroy more objects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <strong>The game is meant to be played for 2-5 people for the optimal experience</strong></p>",
